OL,3,CIs Jeff Bezos buying Liverpool FC?
OL,5,FAmazon founder Jeff Bezos, one of the
OL,6,Fworld's richest men with an estimated
OL,7,Ffortune of #192billion according to
OL,8,FForbes, is reportedly set to join a
OL,9,Fhigh-powered consortium led by Amit
OL,10,FBhatia, the son-in-law of steel tycoon
OL,11,FLakshmi Mittal, and Facebook co-
OL,12,Ffounder Eduardo Saverin.
OL,14,FThe group is in advanced talks to buy
OL,15,Fa roughly one-third stake in Liverpool
OL,16,FFC, with a formal announcement on the
OL,17,Fdeal expected within days.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
