OL,3,CIs Jeff Bezos buying Liverpool FC?
OL,5,FIt is not the first time one of the
OL,6,Fworld's richest men has been linked
OL,7,Fwith the club, in January 2025, Elon
OL,8,FMusk's father revealed his son was
OL,9,Finterested in buying a stake because
OL,10,Fhe has an "emotional attachment" to
OL,11,Fthe city.
OL,13,FWhat is Fenway Sports Group's role?
OL,15,FFenway Sports Group (FSG), which also
OL,16,Fowns the Boston Red Sox and Pittsburgh
OL,17,FPenguins, has controlled Liverpool
OL,18,Fsince 2010.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
