OL,3,CIs Jeff Bezos buying Liverpool FC?
OL,5,FFSG bought the club for #300 million
OL,6,Fwhen it was struggling financially,
OL,7,Fand Forbes now values Liverpool at
OL,8,Faround #4.6 billion, making the deal
OL,9,Fone of the biggest in football history.
OL,11,FDoes it mean Jeff Bezos will 'own'
OL,12,FLiverpool FC?
OL,14,FThe new investment would see the
OL,15,Fconsortium, including Bezos and
OL,16,FSaverin, become co-owners of Liverpool
OL,17,Fwith a stake of more than 30%.
OL,19,FThis follows a similar, smaller stake
OL,20,Fbought by Dynasty Equity in 2025.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
