OL,3,CIs Jeff Bezos buying Liverpool FC?
OL,5,FFSG will remain the controlling
OL,6,Fshareholder, but the arrival of such
OL,7,Fhigh-profile, wealthy investors
OL,8,Fsignals a new era of financial muscle
OL,9,Fat Anfield.
OL,11,FWhy are they investing?
OL,13,FTop football clubs like Liverpool are
OL,14,Fnow seen as valuable global brands and
OL,15,F"asset classes" for the world's
OL,16,Frichest investors.
