OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F361A1786376898
OL,3,CIs Jeff Bezos buying Liverpool FC?
OL,5,FFor Bezos, this would be his first
OL,6,Fmajor move into football, having
OL,7,Fpreviously explored bids for NFL
OL,8,Fteams. Saverin, meanwhile, was part of
OL,9,Fan unsuccessful group that tried to
OL,10,Fbuy Chelsea in 2022.
OL,12,FWhat does it mean for Liverpool fans
OL,13,Fand the club's future?
OL,15,FWhat happens next?
OL,17,FIf finalised, the deal will mark one
OL,18,Fof the largest minority stake
OL,19,Finvestments in football history and
OL,20,Ffurther secure Liverpool's position
OL,21,Famong the sport's financial elite.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
