OL,3,CIs Jeff Bezos buying Liverpool FC?
OL,5,FThe announcement could come this week,
OL,6,Fbut sources say it may slip into next
OL,7,Fweek as the details are finalised.
OL,9,FLiverpool fans will be watching
OL,10,Fclosely, hoping this new era brings
OL,11,Fboth stability and more silverware to
OL,12,FAnfield.
